t/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Parikshit-Sahrawat/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Parikshit-Sahrawat/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Monitoring Setup showed GET and empty optional assertions after reloading an active HEAD check. This fixes DEV05-001 by restoring the canonical authorized collector configuration, worker and persisted rule/template selections. Controls appear only when hydration finishes; source/organization changes, stale responses, previews and user edits are guarded. Diagnostics polling never replaces form edits.\n\nReuses existing activation and redacted collector read endpoints. Activation adds only rule-version IDs/template metadata, and new activations persist the template flag. Worker execution, HTTPS/method/header restrictions, network policy and tenant boundaries are unchanged.\n\nRefs #66 and original failed verification PR #65. This is a separate draft against main; PR #65, its harness assertions/default baseline and failed evidence remain untouched.\n\nTested product commit: `77c9d8b15caf8304fe626f711c219a95fc4f297a` (baseline `f617cc653a965c2ad1bb7edf9e20237e40044b97`). A separate adapter ran the byte-identical PR #65 harness against the committed fix and recorded provenance. The exact previously failing Playwright assertions pass: HEAD, 10000, dev05-ui after full reload/reopen.\n\nValidation:\n- Frontend: 36 tests passed, lint/build passed.\n- Focused backend activation/authorization/API/security: 30 tests passed.\n- Disposable Docker: 21 PASS, 0 FAIL, 1 BLOCKED, 1 NOT TESTED groups. Includes real TLS GET/HEAD, persisted evidence, alert OPEN→RESOLVED, dashboard, Linux process lifecycle, tenant/worker isolation and 22 negative/TLS checks.\n- Existing Docker backend contracts: 63 passed, 2 explicit Contrib-binary skips. Genuine provider certification remains blocked/out of scope.\n- All three verification attempts cleaned up their own containers, networks, volumes and synthetic secrets. Original failed iterations are retained honestly; final evidence has no failed checks.\n\n[Dated remediation report](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/blob/fix/dev-05-1-saved-api-settings-rehydration/docs/verification/dev051/2026-10-25/REMEDIATION.md) includes before/after values, screenshots, raw outcomes, hashes, cleanup and remaining limitations. [Adapter instructions](https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard/blob/fix/dev-05-1-saved-api-settings-rehydration/verification/dev051/README.md).\n\nNo production deployment, real customer access, manual reruns of unrelated CI workflows or automatic merge. Review required.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-25T07:05:36Z","updated_at":"2026-10-25T07:32:22Z","closed_at":"2026-10-25T07:32:22Z","merged_at":"2026-10-25T07:32:22Z","merge_commit_sha":"09a578f70282c7889a515c332c948f1940ae6719","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"Parikshit-Sahrawat:fix/dev-05-1-saved-api-settings-rehydration","ref":"fix/dev-05-1-saved-api-settings-rehydration","repo":{"id":1409408069,"node_id":"R_kgDOVAHcRQ","name":"OpsControl_Dashboard","full_name":"Parikshit-Sahrawat/OpsControl_Dashboard","owner":{"login":"Parikshit-Sahrawat","id":45139666,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTM5NjY2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45139666?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Parikshit-Sahrawat","html_url":"https://github.com/Parikshit-Sahrawat","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Parikshit-Sahrawat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Parikshit-Sahrawat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Parikshit-Sahrawat/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Parikshit-Sahrawat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Parikshit-S